### Get Live Calls
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calls/live
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Originate Call
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls?number=+998901234567&scenarioId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Originate Call with an AI agent (its published version, own scenario and voice)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls?number=%2B998901234567&agentId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Play Audio in Call
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/channel-123/play?file=greeting.wav
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Say Text in Call
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/channel-123/say?text=Assalomu%20alaykum&language=uz-UZ
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Hangup Call
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/channel-123/hangup
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Transfer Call to Human Operator
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/channel-123/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1

### Browser test call session (campaign profile; targetId optional)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/web-test
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "campaignId": 1 }

### Browser test call — an agent on its own (draft), no campaign
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/web-test
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Company-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aiAgentId": 1 }

### Reanalysis — how many calls and roughly what it would cost
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reanalyses/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aiAgentId": 1, "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "to": "2026-10-09T00:00:00Z" }

### Reanalysis — queue it
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reanalyses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aiAgentId": 1, "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "to": "2026-10-09T00:00:00Z" }

### Reanalysis — progress
GET http://localhost:8080/api/call-reanalyses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Reanalysis — the company's jobs
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reanalyses/filter
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "page": 0, "size": 20, "status": "RUNNING" }

### Reanalysis — cancel
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reanalyses/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
